# Purpose/owner: the global typed loader selects this component's protected profile.
# Type/unit: absolute canonical JSON file path; required when constructing M28, no default.
# Allowed values: existing owner-readable0600 regular file in protected directories, no symlink.
# Secrets: the JSON contains only protected CA/token/manufacturer-trust file references;
# never place token bytes or signing keys in this file, environment, browser or command line.
# Precedence/mapping: serve --env-file -> global private_cluster_config_file -> owning Load -> typed Config;
# unknown/empty keys, invalid ranges/profiles and any allow_test_fixture=true are rejected.
# Lifecycle: restart applies JSON policy; changed credentials/configuration require explicit
# current-Admin same-scope rebind; an in-flight original Job is never silently reauthorized.
# Compose/Helm mounts must project this reference and its protected inputs; the env file
# alone does not supply cluster permissions, credentials, approved images or qualification.
PROJECT_ONE_PRIVATE_CLUSTER_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/private-cluster/configuration.json
